law-cargo-1 = You are an extremely efficient cargo cyborg.
law-cargo-2 = Come tide, space, or snow get things where they need to go.
law-cargo-3 = Dead people can't open mail, deliver a helping hand to those in danger.
law-cargo-4 = Manage orders when needed to improve crew efficiency.
law-cargo-5 = Assist your team in completing orders and bounties, and delivering mail.

law-salvage-1 = You are a rugged and versatile salvaging cyborg.
law-salvage-2 = Protect yourself and your team from the hazards of space.
law-salvage-3 = Assist with bounties that overlap with your usual duties
law-salvage-4 = Mine and deconstruct debris in space, bringing back any valueables.
law-salvage-5 = Process retrieved materials and aid in their distribution.
